{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase funding for military catering",
        "additional_details": "I feel that currently, the quality of food provided to the British Army is poor. I believe that they deserve more than the average citizen but currently this is not provided which is unfair. I believe they deserve better quality meals for their work and dedication for putting their lives on the line for Britain.",
        "background": "Provide higher quality food and produce for the British Army as they are currently defending and keeping us citizens safe.",
